{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此頌理即佛也。動靜理全是者，謂一動一靜，約理全是佛性也。行藏事盡非者，行藏即動\n靜也。由不達萬法唯心，故所作事，動靜約事，全不合理也。冥冥隨物去者，謂佛性之體，隨六塵而流轉也。\n\n杳杳不知歸者，無有覺照之功，故不知歸也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此頌名字即佛也。方聽無生曲，始聞不死歌者，悟得佛性之理也，佛性本不生滅也。今知\n當體是者，現在當體，苦即法身，惑即般若，業即解脫也。翻恨自蹉跎者，翻恨理即位中行藏，事盡非也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此頌觀行即佛也。念念照常理者，明觀照之功也。常理，即不生不滅法身理也。心心息幻\n塵者，幻塵即五住地惑也。謂正當照常理時，五住便息而不起也。遍觀諸法性者，謂二邊法性也。無假亦\n無真者，全體中道，故曰非假非真也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此頌相似即佛也。四住，謂見、思二惑。見為一住，思為三住。先落，謂法執後斷，我執先斷也。\n六塵未空者，法執未忘也。由法執故，故曰眼中有翳，空裏見花紅也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "豁爾心開悟者，以中道觀智，豁破無明一品也。湛然一切通者，六塵空也。窮源未盡者，還\n有四十一品無明未盡，故曰尚見月朦朧也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從來，指前五位也。真是妄者，三德之真，全成三障之妄也，如水成冰也。今日者，指今究竟\n位也。妄皆真者，三障之妄，全成三德之真也。但復本時性者，復還其本時之佛性也。更無一法新者，非從\n冰外更得水也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即心是佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即佛是心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不簡機務"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不假方便"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自覺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺滿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "學者須如此深研痛拶，不可徒落在語言，作道理領過。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋迦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彌陀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欣厭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "極樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三業"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三資糧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四淨土"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋迦諸佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彌陀依正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "學者須從者裏死盡偷心，不可草草"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心性為自"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以教為他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以念佛為因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以已生者為果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以境為事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以法界為理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下明願"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即理之事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即事之理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "願"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信則便信，擬議則不堪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "理經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古人圓極語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "根據了了"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從來未經道徹如此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鐵案"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "願王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "成佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解中判「爾時」下三十八字為別序，六方佛為流通，與古不同，故科釋之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿歐，此云有無。謂外道經書前，皆安阿歐二字。\n標其所計，不出有無二見。部內所言，不出所計也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悟此者少"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵王師陳如，帝釋師迦葉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之位，其德為"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云身子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大采菽氏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大飲光"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大文飾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大膝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "星宿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繼道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慶喜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覆障"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牛呞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不動利根"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黑光"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "房宿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善容"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無貧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云寂靜處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云妙德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云\n無能勝，彌勒菩薩之名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云不休息"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事是大因緣，理是秘密藏，不可忽過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唯廣大，故微妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "娑婆世界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從未道徹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可見正智庸愚，兩不思議"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙答。從來答者，反添戲論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譌謬悉正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西方是同居淨，以凡夫例聖故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西方是方便淨，以小乘迴心故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西方是實報淨，以所證圓頓故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西方是寂光淨，以受用同佛故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以經中是同居境故，以上善俱會故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此論修德，不論性德。性德則一切微塵，法爾具足四種淨薉佛土。今約信願行三，彌陀名號，不可思議。故\n能令凡夫所感，同居極樂，最極清淨也。此則十方佛土，所無極樂，同居獨擅，方是極樂淨土宗旨。下明義\n處皆然。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切微塵具足佛土者，萬法唯心，微塵亦唯心。心淨故土淨，心薉故土薉，任運之理，故曰法爾具足。\n極樂雖云修德，亦是性所本具，不出性外也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此論性德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此論修德，以是同居土中見故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以佛身隨橫，四土現故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四悉檀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世界悉檀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為人悉檀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非魔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非邪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對治悉檀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非權，破《華嚴合論》之譌。非邪，破末世積迷之習。此二料簡，尤大有關\n係。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一義悉檀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對此土釋迦不久住，彌勒未生，無現佛可依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此字指一體三寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是真指南"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語如山岳，不可動移。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨宗不思議在此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾苦極樂映釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方是極樂淨宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此亦轉釋上無有眾苦，但受諸樂之故。下廣釋一科亦然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以嚴際畔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以嚴空界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以嚴露地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內因、外緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此論性，依此起修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此論修，全修在性，如是方是極樂淨宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "絕待之樂，為濁世眾生，須對待而論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "海鹹河淡，餘水味劣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "㴼者臭也，腐者爛也，褪色者日久色變也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沴者不和，戾者違戾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此義約佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此義約生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誰解承當"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性相圓明，撤盡法門邊畔界限"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會上二義，秪是一義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中間"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上嚴空界，下嚴金地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但可順此方比擬，不可隨此方情見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五邪命皆\n為利養：一、詐現異相奇特；二、自說功德；三、占相吉凶，為人說法；四、高聲現威，令人敬畏；五、說所得供養，以\n動人心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皆有訂譌之功"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方是極樂淨宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此三句各具四益，詳見下釋念三寶中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名字法界，不可思議如此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此經悉檀，皆是第一義中具下三悉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可謂法界標指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性相圓明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛性修，皆是性，生是修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離土談心，定是緣影妄想"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "深契佛心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "確妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "速須信入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切諸佛之心要"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可悟心佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方是極樂淨宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "例下壽命，確極不然。佛光皆照十方，何勞頌祝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壽命皆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上重重無盡，總歸極於一聲名號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此科關係極大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "纔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼土"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三不退"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "極樂淨宗，如此如此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如上無上大事因緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幸得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不可算數一生補處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石火電光"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "多善根福德因緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "得生彼國"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方是極樂淨宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "實話"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世有此一輩，以持名壓捺妄想，不知求生，故為極力道破。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓極語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可訂久譌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仍不廢事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此初學要期之法，下根則有若干七日，亦是隨樂剋期之法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此久學練習之法，中、下根亦有若干七日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可訂久譌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字字引商刻羽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以念念即佛故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以念念即佛故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方是極樂淨宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓收所以圓超"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兼為《觀經》發𫎇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此念字謂觀想，出《觀經》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真宗之脫離窠臼老作家"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平常之極，愚者未免驚其孤崚，所謂難信之法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寶鑑照妖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "確確"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即心故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即佛故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讀者當知，此優曇鉢羅出現時也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此解確甚，令人骨寒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蘇東坡弟蘇子由，謫廣東高安縣。時洞山雲菴與聰禪師，一夕同夢五祖戒禪\n師明至，遂與子由出城迓之。已而東坡至，三人說所夢。坡曰：「八九歲時，夢身是僧，徃來陝右。又先妣孕時，\n\n夢一眇目僧求寄宿。」雲菴驚曰：「戒公，陝右人，一目眇。」逆數其終，已五十年。時東坡四十九。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○宋朝草堂青\n禪師。有曾家婦人，嘗為齋供及布施衣物。和尚感其恩，乃言：「老僧與夫人作子。」一日，此婦人生子，使人看\n草堂，已坐化矣。所生子，曾魯公也。以前世為僧，常福慧雙修，故少年登高科，其後作宰相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○唐朝惠林寺\n沙門圓澤。與隱士李源厚善。惠林即源舊第也。父憕，守東都，為祿山所害。源以故不仕，常居寺中，與澤相\n約遊峨嵋山。源欲自荊州，澤欲由斜谷。源以久絕人事，不欲復入京師。澤不能強，遂自荊州。舟次南浦，見\n一婦人汲水，澤望而泣曰：「所不欲由此者，為是耳。」源驚問其故。澤曰：「婦人孕三年矣。遲吾為之子。不逢則\n已。今既見之。無可逃者。公當以符助我。令速生三日，願公臨以一笑為信。後十三年，於杭州天竺寺外。當\n與公相見。」源悲哀具浴。至暮澤亡。婦乳三日，源徃視之，兒見源果笑，即以故語其家。葬訖，源返寺中。後如\n期自洛之杭赴其約，於葛洪井畔，聞有牧童扣牛角而歌曰：「三生石上舊精魂，賞月吟風莫要論。慚愧情\n人遠相訪，此身雖異性常存。」源曰：「澤公健否？」答曰：「李君真信士也。然世緣未盡，且勿相近。唯勤修不惰，乃\n復相見。」又歌曰：「身前身後事茫茫，欲話因緣恐斷腸。吳越江山遊已徧，却𢌞煙棹上瞿塘。」遂隱不見。源復\n惠林寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "切膚刻骨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牙慧者能不瞠然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生善破惡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "確確"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "確確"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明白之極。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸經論中\n亦有橫義，乃隨斷惑淺深，即於同居見上三土。是則約證名橫，約斷仍豎也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏二乘，通三乘，\n別三賢，圓十信"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不退、一生等義，皆攝第二義中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大有功於淨土"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伶俐者少"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "土佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "細研下答，亦非善問。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "願勝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "標心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歡喜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破惡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本不出法界外"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "何以加於法界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解千餘年之惑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "稱讚功德之名，上來已詳言矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "耶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此皆淨宗指訣，世人多夢夢不了，所以雖修無功"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有此義，方使一生要期非謬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有此義，方能深入一行三昧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即理之事，非徒論理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古有可久大師，常誦《法華》，呼為久法華。元祐八年坐化，越三日還，謂人曰：「吾遊淨土，\n見諸勝境，與經符契。此間修淨業者，華萼皆已標名。標金台者，一成都廣教院勳公，一明州孫十二郎，一\n可久。標銀台者，明州徐道姑。」言訖復化。徐道姑亡，異香滿室。孫十二郎亡，天樂鳴空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○越國夫人王氏，宋\n哲宗從父荊王之妻。導諸妾婢，專修淨土。後有一婢，無疾而逝。其夕，夫人夢婢致謝：「幸𫎇訓責，得生淨土\n矣。」夫人曰：「西方可至乎？」婢曰：「可。」遂導夫人。頃之，見一大池，中有蓮華，大小間錯，或榮或悴。夫人問其故，婢\n曰：「世間修西方者，纔發一念，此中便生一華。勤惰不同，榮悴亦異。」中有一人，朝服而坐，寶冠瓔珞，莊嚴其\n身。夫人問曰：「何人耶？」婢曰：「楊傑也。」又一人朝服而坐，又問：「何人？」曰：「馬玗也。」兩人俱修淨業，事具本傳。夫人\n問曰：「我當生何處？」婢導之行。可數里，見一華台，金碧輝煌，光明洞然。曰：「此夫人生處，乃金台上品上生也。」\n既覺，悲喜交至。其年遇生日，晨起，秉爐焚香，望觀音閣而立。諸眷方趣前為壽，眂之，則已立化去矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句重在持名，故是勸行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "突圍而出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "意見不容"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無取無捨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "取捨熾然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六道皆在內"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應量而飽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨宗千古之蘊，一旦發靈，希有哉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此五段，應與五必不能度之訓合觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當知甚難之旨，從未經道破"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "確然確然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "功在萬世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吐心吐膽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現身說法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言有不獲已者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字字道實，果然果然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上繖下悟，紅螺山第一代"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徹悟三寶弟子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上懷下仁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余"}
